+  /**
+   * Determines whether this node is testing for the existence of a property.
+   * Mirrors the logic in TypeCheck#isPropertyTest for the cases relevant here.
+   * If true, we upgrade locally-inferred UNKNOWNs to CHECKED_UNKNOWN.
